<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender for 30,000T US corn/soy.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender for 30,000T US corn/soy.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp</p>
<p>will tender on July 29 for a combined shipment of 18,000 tonnes</p>
<p>U.S. corn and 12,000 U.S. soybean, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>			  U.S. Gulf	    Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Corn     18,000  August 5-20  August 21-September 5</p>
<p>Soybeans 12,000  August 5-20  August 21-September 5</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
